OL,3,GNEWSAI took up karate after I was
OL,4,Abullied - now I'm world champion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student who took up karate after
OL,7,Fbeing bullied at school has won gold
OL,8,Ffor England at the Karate World
OL,9,FChampionships.
OL,11,FPaulina "Lina" Makazlieva, 19, from
OL,12,FKidderminster, Worcestershire, claimed
OL,13,Fthree medals at the International
OL,14,FCombat Organisation tournament in
OL,15,FFrance, including gold in the kumite
OL,16,Fsparring competition.
OL,18,FThe University of Worcester law student
OL,19,Fsaid she first turned to the sport six
OL,20,Fyears ago after experiencing bullying
OL,21,Fduring her school years and wanting to
OL,22,Flearn self-defence.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
